  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine: Rapid response to persisting and emerging war-related challenges</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This 18-months measure will mobilise assistance to strengthen Ukraine&#xbf;s resilience in dealing with persisting and emerging challenges. A first component will put in place a procurement facility dedicated to Ukraine, in order to provide rapid equipment assistance  (material and non-material). A second component will support targeted urgent energy interventions, with a special view to frontline areas. A third component will enable rapid response to emerging societal challenges related to the war as well as possible new geopolitical dynamics and disruptions.</narrative>
  </description>
